  m_text: "The air is crisp, shifting timbers of a vast wooden deck have been assembled
    into an arena\u2014ambience of the Age of Iron & Sail. Towering sails snap in
    the wind, a peaceful middle ages town nearby, distant cogs and galleons heel
    through the gray sea, but the battlefield is here.\r\n\r\nJames your teams mechanic
    comes and speaks to you.\r\n"
